        {
            "id": "https://meeridesign.github.io/violence-against-women-poster.html",
            "url": "https://meeridesign.github.io/violence-against-women-poster.html",
            "title": "Violence Against Women Poster",
            "summary": "This poster was created on March 8, International Women’s Day, as a&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"711\">This poster was created on March 8, International Women’s Day, as a statement against violence toward women. Inspired by the “Woman, Life, Freedom” movement in Iran, the work raises awareness of the systemic abuse and injustice many women continue to face, especially in Iran, where women have been punished simply for showing their hair or demanding basic rights.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"869\">One of the driving forces behind this design was the staggering global reality: every day, an average of 137 women are killed by a partner or family member.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/gallery/Artboard-24x-100.jpg\" data-size=\"x\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/gallery/Artboard-24x-100-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1075\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/gallery/A4-Paper-Mockup-2.png\" data-size=\"4000x2666\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/gallery/A4-Paper-Mockup-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/gallery/Poster-Mockup-4.png\" data-size=\"2164x2546\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/gallery/Poster-Mockup-4-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"904\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
            "image": "https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/6/POSTER-MOCKUP-FILE-2.png",
            "author": {
