        {
            "id": "https://meeridesign.github.io/capitano-coffee-packaging-design.html",
            "url": "https://meeridesign.github.io/capitano-coffee-packaging-design.html",
            "title": "Capitano Coffee Packaging Design",
            "summary": "This coffee packaging project was my BA thesis, created to make Capitano&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p class=\"\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"616\">This coffee packaging project was my BA thesis, created to make Capitano stand out with bold illustrations and a unique color palette. The brand is inspired by a fictional captain, sailing in search of the world’s finest coffee.</p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"908\">Each illustration tells part of his story and highlights a different brewing method. The visual style draws from 9th–10th century Nishapur ceramics, giving the brand a sense of cultural richness and authenticity. Bright colors and a clean white background make it eye-catching on the shelf.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--wide\"><div class=\"gallery\"  data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/jhm1.5x-2.png\" data-size=\"5022x4136\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/jhm1.5x-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"633\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/436-v2-03-paper-shopping-bag-mockup2x-3.png\" data-size=\"3841x3434\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/436-v2-03-paper-shopping-bag-mockup2x-3-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"687\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/436-v2-02-paper-shopping-bag-mockup1.5x-2.png\" data-size=\"3396x2884\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/436-v2-02-paper-shopping-bag-mockup1.5x-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"652\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-01-copy-2.png\" data-size=\"3500x2300\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-01-copy-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"505\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-02-copy-2.png\" data-size=\"3027x2046\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-02-copy-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"519\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-03-2.png\" data-size=\"2117x1757\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-03-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"637\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-042x-2.png\" data-size=\"4497x4114\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://meeridesign.github.io/media/posts/2/gallery/159-coffee-beans-pouch-mockup-042x-2-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"capitano coffee packaging\" width=\"768\" height=\"703\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
